Privacy Policy
Last Updated: February 2026
SPL Mentor is an educational study support application. We respect user privacy.
1. Data Collection
The app does not collect, store, or host personal data on the developer’s own servers.
All user data remains locally on the user’s device and under the user’s control.

2. AI Services
The app uses third-party AI services to generate educational responses.
Text entered into AI-powered features may be securely transmitted to the AI service provider for processing.
The data is processed solely for generating responses.
The developer does not store, track, or analyze this data.
Third-party providers operate under their own privacy policies.

3. Payments and Subscriptions
All subscription payments are processed and managed by Apple.
The app does not access or store payment information.

4. Data Sharing
The developer does not sell or share user data.

